  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "The contrast between trapping in the Hebrew passages and knocking in Aramaic leaves the historical relationship uncertain. Psalm 9:17 has an active-looking participle where the surrounding image suggests the wicked person is caught. The corpus also places nard here, already covered under נרד. Nergal and Nergal-sharezer have different consonants."
